{"id":"0cf18babd723d3c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Recursively Inaccessible Ordinal","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Recursively Inaccessible Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Recursively Inaccessible Ordinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-inaccessible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Recursively Inaccessible Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1e68a0f54b805bf\" href=\"?note=a1e68a0f54b805bf\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyInaccessibleOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyInaccessibleOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyInaccessibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\beta&lt;\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\land \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\gamma))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyInaccessibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\beta&lt;\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\land \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\gamma))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> is admissible and a limit point of the admissible ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal